Prototype for Mic92/hestia v3.1.0 (dfed9ced335d28978ba74e513939a10db1f71025).

Use the published CacheMetadata.scope protobuf field for separate PR/default
manifest reads, union their contents, and reserve above both observed indices.
The mock test proves local mechanics, including gaps and non-monotonic reads.
Whether the live GitHub service honors this metadata selector is UNVERIFIED;
validate that before treating the patch as a working production fix.

Protocol definitions:
https://github.com/actions/toolkit/blob/main/packages/cache/src/generated/results/api/v1/cache.ts
https://github.com/actions/toolkit/blob/main/packages/cache/src/generated/results/entities/v1/cachemetadata.ts
https://github.com/actions/toolkit/blob/main/packages/cache/src/generated/results/entities/v1/cachescope.ts

